.TH "REUSE-SPDX" "1" "Dec 17, 2025" "6.2.0" "reuse"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
reuse-spdx \- Generate SPDX bill of materials
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBreuse spdx\fP [\fIoptions\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBreuse\-spdx\fP generates an SPDX bill of materials for the project.
.sp
The bill of materials is output to STDOUT.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output FILE
Write the bill of materials to a file instead of writing it to STDOUT.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-add\-license\-concluded
Instead of writing \(aqNOASSERTION\(aq to LicenseConcluded, write an expression that
is the logical equivalent of AND\-ing all found expressions.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-creator\-person
Name of the creator (person) of the bill of materials.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-creator\-organization
Name of the creator (organization) of the bill of materials.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display help and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Free Software Foundation Europe
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
2017, Free Software Foundation Europe. CC-BY-SA-4.0
